<title>INDONESIA: Texmaco Perkasa says 1996 net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Texmaco Perkasa says 1996 net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    65.81 vs  27.04</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)     270   vs  111</p>
<p>    Net sales			    405.85 vs 168.88</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 141.16 vs  54.62</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   124.19 vs  39.72</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			92.04 vs  33.96</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		   69.41 vs  38.11</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT Texmaco Perkasa Engineering is a textile machinery manufacturer.</p>
</text>
